openmediavault-ro-api (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial release of openmediavault Read-Only API & Infisical Auditor plugin.
  * Provides token-authenticated RoApiProxy::query JSON-RPC endpoint with
    granular UI-controlled read scopes, automatic server-side password/secret
    redaction, subnet allowlisting, and optional Infisical Universal Auth sync.

